  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">You have become close to the powers that represent your benefactor, and in a show of force you can transform into a form of your own that resembles them. </span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.5c692cCcTDXjSEzk]{Dragon Form} innate spell that you can cast as an 8th rank arcane spell once per day. You must transform into a dragon that shares the same form and scale as your Drachiri Benefactor, and you use your normal AC if it is higher than what is granted by the battle form.</span></p>"
